sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Admin
  participant L as Local Workspace
  participant S as SharePoint
  A->>S: Read current manifest
  A->>L: Copy Access snapshot
  A->>L: Apply approved requests
  A->>L: Validate and checksum
  A->>S: Re-read manifest
  alt version unchanged
    A->>S: Publish versioned ACCDB and manifest
  else version changed
    A-->>A: Abort and reconcile
  end
